# HACS-managed submodule integrations: custom_components/<domain> is a plain
# rsync copy of submodules/<repo>/custom_components/<domain>, not a symlink
# and not tracked here — the submodule is the source of truth. See
# scripts/sync-submodule-to-custom-components.sh and AGENTS.md.
